Subject: [PATCH] ProofScope v0.5: theorem intelligence, comparison
 certificates, benchmark, viewer

Engine slice of the v1.0 roadmap:
- Lean metaprogram + driver for elaborator-based theorem dossiers (Project Audit S8)
- generic certificate gate: clean module, standard-axiom policy, leanchecker replay
- theorem-level comparison with certified applicability/conclusion gaps, vacuity,
  equivalence, coverage and strict strengthening
- benchmark: 33 dev + 20 held-out (post-freeze) cases, 20 adversarial certificates
- offline HTML viewer; ProofScope Engine workflow
v0.1-v0.4 workflows unchanged.

